Protocol: KDF ratchet

State: 
CK <- new

Knowledge:
A: A,B,CK,kdfl,kdfr,h
B: A,B,CK,kdfl,kdfr,h

Actions:

Repeat 3:
A -> B: {| format(Msg1)|}_kdfr(CK)

B -> A: {| ack(h(Msg1))|}_kdfr(CK)

Let:
CK1 = kdfl(CK)

New State:
CK = CK1

EndRepeat

Goals:
Msg1 secret between A,B;
Msg2 secret between A,B;
Msg3 secret between A,B;
B weakly authenticates A on Msg1;
B weakly authenticates A on Msg2;
B weakly authenticates A on Msg3;
